             The status of the watchdog timer. 0 if not running, or 1 if run‐
             ning.

     _d_e_v_._w_d_a_t_w_d_._%_d_._t_i_m_e_o_u_t
             The current value of the watchdog timeout in millisecond.  This
             can be 0 on some systems, and the zero value means that the de‐
